{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/992755-minor-template-index","id":992755,"title":"Minor template index","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-10-24T21:23:42-07:00","id":992755,"title":"Minor template index","content":"Just wondering, is there anything like an index of all the known minor templates and minor supernatural types out there? And if not, it seems like it would be worthwhile to make one. I'm a huge fan of minor templates, so it seems like it'd be a neat project. It could be useful for chronicles, as well, especially Blue Book and Hunter.<br /> <br /> The end goal would be to have a reference, something like a complete list of minor templates, a short description, and the book and page number where it can be found.<br /> <br /> Fan created minor templates are welcomed as well. In particular, we could really use a minor-template or second sight-style system for mad scientists. The God Machine Chronicle describes people hacking the machine in various ways, maybe mechanics for that?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":5358,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","user":"Geckopirateship","date":". 10-25-2016, 12:50 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-25T18:51:27-07:00","id":993229,"title":"","content":"In addition to minor templates, it could also be useful to add in book and page locations of supernatural merits and systems of magic (Second Sight's magic, Witch Finder's gutter magic, blood magic, and so o